    "ecom-carbon-cartridges-pair-product": {
      "textcontent_t3m7n6141aa_html": "<p>Time to Replace Your Cartridge?</p><p>You’re right where you need to be.</p><p>Meet the Phoenix Smart Carbon Cartridges, powered by premium coconut shell–based activated carbon, engineered to purify every drop with unmatched precision. It removes up to 99.99% of impurities, giving you water that’s pure, crisp, and refreshing, just as nature intended.</p><p>For consistently flawless performance, replace your Phoenix Smart Carbon Cartridges every 12 months and keep your water as clean and vibrant as the day you first poured it.</p>",
      "headingtext_5z2v222uxpf_html": "<p>Looking for the complete Phoenix Gravity System?&nbsp;<a href=\"/products/the-phoenix-gravity-water-filter\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">Find it here.</font></a></p>",
      "product_option_swatch_pjrmcxadlw_html": "Color",
      "shipping_policy_7ps5qwdft9f_html": "<a href=\"{{ link }}\">Shipping</a> calculated at checkout.",
      "product_single_sale_text_7ps5qwdft9f_html": "Sale {price}%",
      "product_single_sold_text_7ps5qwdft9f_html": "Out of stock",
      "add_to_cart_a2irei5s31e_html": "ADD",
      "pre_order_a2irei5s31e_html": "Pre Order",
      "product_unavailable_a2irei5s31e_html": "Unavailable",
      "out_stock_a2irei5s31e_html": "Out of stock",
      "added_cart_text_a2irei5s31e_html": "ADD",
      "added_cart_message_a2irei5s31e_html": "Added to cart",
      "item_title_0_ajneihjk7t_html": "What’s in the box?",
      "item_title_1_ajneihjk7t_html": "Key Features",
      "item_title_2_ajneihjk7t_html": "Shipping and Returns",
      "item_title_3_ajneihjk7t_html": "Compatibility",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomfejyfsoqgvu_fejyfsoqgvu_html": "100 day money-back guarantee when purchased with the complete Phoenix Gravity system",
      "title0_zfv9thbyw6_html": "Retains 100%  nutrients",
      "title1_zfv9thbyw6_html": "Highest grade (CTC  60) coconut shells",
      "title2_zfv9thbyw6_html": "Impregnated with silver to stop bacteria growth",
      "title3_zfv9thbyw6_html": "Less waste, fewer  refills, lower cost",
      "title4_zfv9thbyw6_html": "Better taste you can  trust for 40+ years",
      "headingtext_yy1fqljkyu_html": "Product description:",
      "textcontent_s63y9322ro8_html": "<ul><li>We’ve created our Smart Cartridges from activated carbon using the highest-grade coconut shells (CTC 60) to create a dense, porous structure that removes 99.99% of parasites, heavy metals, chemicals and other contaminants - without removing the nutrients your body needs.</li><li>Traps physical contaminants more than 20 times smaller than jug filters.</li></ul>",
      "textcontent_hki5ai1vfa_html": "<ul><li>Silver-impregnated to prevent bacteria growth keeping your water safer for longer.</li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the most effective, sustainable and durable filtration on the market.</li></ul>",
      "view_more_text_e6nyvxh4m6c_html": "View more",
      "view_less_text_e6nyvxh4m6c_html": "View less",
      "headingtext_8tpy34r3gxa_html": "Designed for durability",
      "textcontent_4zjao1ug2xg_html": " <ul><li>Our activated carbon cartridges are designed for minimum replacement, and can last up to 20000 litre for pair.</li><li>Need replacing only once per year<br></li></ul>",
      "headingtext_kopme0edc4_html": "Two-stage filtration at its finest",
      "textcontent_5g47vwomve6_html": "<b>Stage one: Tortuous Path</b><div>Activated carbon creatives a tortuous path that contaminants like microplastics, cysts and bacteria cannot pass through<div>Chemicals like chlorine, lead, pesticides and more are absorbed by activated surface&nbsp;<br></div><div><b>Stage Two: Sterilising&nbsp;</b></div><div>Impregnated silver sterilises water and prevents growth of bacteria or mould</div></div>",
      "headingtext_5v60cl4gc2o_html": "Better quality you can taste, on tap.",
      "buttoncontent_0rgje3f41ts_html": "Terms and conditions",
      "headingtext_fhjkx1svqdu_html": "Filtration At Its Finest",
      "headingtext_gw9idxxrc6r_html": "Removes 99.99% of harmful<div>contaminants</div>",
      "title0_d46rozaj6fm_html": "Viruses",
      "text0_d46rozaj6fm_html": "Can enter water via sewage systems and<div>animal waste and cause disease. </div>",
      "title0_yoop7e6vav_html": "Chlorine",
      "text0_yoop7e6vav_html": "Impacts the taste and smell of your&nbsp;<div>drinking water. </div>",
      "title0_9uj17kv0q26_html": "Bacteria",
      "text0_9uj17kv0q26_html": "Can contaminate water via septic systems&nbsp;<div>and sewers.</div>",
      "title0_9rv0bf53yjw_html": "Heavy metals",
      "text0_9rv0bf53yjw_html": "Can leach into drinking water from&nbsp;<div>household plumbing.</div>",
      "title0_z8hnds5w2p_html": "Parasites",
      "text0_z8hnds5w2p_html": "Can contaminate water through animal&nbsp;<div>waste and cause serious illness. </div>",
      "headingtext_x3te08mpwy_html": "While protecting important&nbsp;<div>nutrients</div>",
      "title0_s37srzkdji_html": "Calcium",
      "text0_s37srzkdji_html": "Helps to strengthen bones<div>&nbsp;and teeth.</div>",
      "title0_hfm5gyr5ieo_html": "Magnesium",
      "text0_hfm5gyr5ieo_html": "Improves sleep and can help<div>&nbsp;strengthen muscles.</div>",
      "title0_l90m2wz39a_html": "Potassium",
      "text0_l90m2wz39a_html": "Can regulate nerve signals and improve&nbsp;<div>heart health.  </div>",
      "title0_urrri3w07k_html": "Chloride",
      "text0_urrri3w07k_html": "Helps to regulate and&nbsp;<div>nourish cells.  </div>",
      "title0_lfuyezs15qh_html": "Sodium",
      "text0_lfuyezs15qh_html": "Can balance water and<div>&nbsp;minerals   </div>",
      "headingtext_07442cuzgaa3_html": "The Phoenix Difference",
      "textcontent_3fn1exz7gxc_html": "\nDesigned and manufactured in-house. Advanced and sustainable drinking water filtration removing 99.99% contaminants whilst retaining 100% nutrients.",
      "headingtext_siluhb2rdu_html": "Ready To Experience Water, As It Should Be?",
      "buttoncontent_ox5hgyna7c_html": "Complete Purchase",
      "headingtext_boou9jta0p_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water<div>Filter with Smart Carbon</div>",
      "headingtext_3e6fy3tch8n_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water<div>&nbsp;Filter with Smart Carbon + Fluoride Removal<div><div></div></div></div>",
      "headingtext_rx2nnd6b3tr_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water Filter with Smart Carbon + Fluoride Removal + Teak Wood Stand<div><div></div></div>",
      "headingtext_ojwd1psj9as_html": "FAQs",
      "item_title_0_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Are the activated carbon cartridges compatible with all gravity filters or just the \nPhoenix Gravity Filter?",
      "item_title_1_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I set it up myself?",
      "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I clean my carbon cartridges?",
      "item_title_3_obyhwb3w3en_html": "How does the Phoenix Gravity Filter compare to plastic jugs or other filters?",
      "textcontent_2j78pjgtjlc_html": "Yes! Our advanced Carbon Cartridges are compatible with all gravity filters including Berkey and Doulton. If you’re not sure about your filter, just drop us a line and we’ll be happy to assist you&nbsp;<a href=\"/pages/contact-us\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">contact here.</font></a><div><br></div>",
      "textcontent_srm4f5b4s5k_html": "Absolutely. The carbon cartridges are easy to replace on your own - without tools or a professional - and installed in your Phoenix Gravity System within minutes.&nbsp;<div><br></div><div>You simply remove the old cartridges from the upper chamber of your filter and replace them with the new. We’ll send detailed assembly instructions with your new delivery - and our team is always available via chat, email and phone to provide help and support. <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">Contact here</font></a><div><div><br></div></div></div>",
      "textcontent_6lqd35wz0ha_html": "Generally, you won’t need to clean your cartridges - but they should be replaced within 18 months. If you notice the flow slows down, it may mean the cartridge is blocked. In this case, you can easily clean your filter in your home using tap water and a soft brush or mild abrasive. We’ll include detailed instructions when we send it to you. <div><br></div>",
      "headingtext_9mrowu6b269_html": "Still have a burning question? See our full FAQs <a href=\"/pages/faq\">here.</a> ",
      "text0_s269ab745x_html": "If you don’t like your water filter, within 100 days we’ll give you a full refund.",
      "buttoncontent_gtwysirke4o_html": "Complete Purchase",
      "headingtext_jqstu3zfqa_html": "The Phoenix difference, straight from the source(s)."
    },
