      "headingtext_93f6jnh7fk7_html": "Product Description",
      "textcontent_and3mic4gr6_html": "<ul><li>The Phoenix Gravity System is easy to set up for \nany worktop in your home or workplace, no \nplumber or electricity required.</li><li>Housed in 304-grade stainless steel, naturally \nBPA-free and non-leaching.</li><li>&nbsp;Activated carbon filters made out from the \nhighest grade coconut shells (CTC 60) and infused \nwith silver to remove 99.99% contaminants and \npreserve the nutrients your body needs.</li></ul>",
      "textcontent_8hcij9b38z7_html": "<ul><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the \nmost effective, sustainable and durable filtration on \nthe market.</li></ul>",
      "headingtext_l61g0k315z_html": "Contaminants Removed",
      "name0_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "microplastics ",
      "title0_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "99%",
