      "title3_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "99%",
      "name4_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "giardia cysts",
      "title4_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "99.99%",
      "name5_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "Viruses",
      "title5_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "99.9%",
      "name6_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "Bacteria",
      "title6_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "99.999%",
      "name7_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "Parasites",
      "title7_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "99.9%",
      "name8_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "Chlorine",
      "title8_jbebz2xwvdc_html": "99%",
      "buttoncontent_pccitw7lx8b_html": "Lab Test Reports",
      "headingtext_bkq614ker3f_html": "Designed for durability",
      "textcontent_sogpech0e2_html": " <ul><li>Unlike plastic filters, Phoenix Gravity’s 304 \nstainless steel housing won’t leach polyurethane, \nmicroplastics or harmful chemicals into your \nwater over time.</li><li>Rust-resistant to withstand the rigours of \neveryday use for 10+ years</li><li>The hand polishing is done with the highest attention to detail to ensure quality, rivaling that of car manufacturers.<br></li></ul>",
      "headingtext_q2kunjc1j6_html": "5-minute assembly",
      "textcontent_811p365hdlk_html": " <ul><li>Install your Phoenix Gravity in 5 minutes or less.</li><li>It is easy to assemble.<br></li><li>No tools are required.<br></li><li>Just use your hands.</li></ul>",
      "headingtext_b26nf97i9fn_html": "5-minute assembly",
      "textcontent_nk4sgk3wbzr_html": " <ul><li>Install your Phoenix Gravity in 5 minutes or less.</li><li>It is easy to assemble.<br></li><li>No tools are required.<br></li><li>Just use your hands.</li></ul>",
      "headingtext_vkpbo5lsyul_html": "How Smart Carbon Cartridges work? ",
      "textcontent_6vkgs9ijmpc_html": " <ul><li>Our Smart Carbon Cartridges rely on mechanical filtration method. The dense porous wall captures physical contaminants like microplastics, sediments, bacteria, cysts and other physical impurities.  </li><li>By way of adsorption, chemical contaminants like chlorine, PFAS, pesticides, and many other chemical molecules get adhered to the surface of the activated carbon. <br></li></ul>",
      "textcontent_yc5ng5rse6_html": " <ul><li>Our activated coconut carbon cartridges filter\nwater for all your drinking and cooking needs.</li><li>Designed for longevity- our\ncartridges last up to 12 months. <br></li><li>This means fewer replacements and lower cost\nper litre. <br></li><li>We use a touch of silver to prevent bacteria re-growth- one of the\nmost common problems with traditional filters.<br></li></ul>",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomtp4dv934so_tp4dv934so_html": "If you don’t like your water filter within 100 days,  we’ll give you a full refund.",
      "buttoncontent_n1q0hx4ytge_html": "Terms & Conditions",
      "headingtext_sjwa6kmwq3n_html": "The Phoenix Difference",
      "textcontent_szsuoj2yyx9_html": "Designed and manufactured in-house. Advanced and sustainable drinking water filtration removing 99.99% contaminants whilst retaining 100% nutrients.",
      "headingtext_lih6irka6pp_html": "Ready To Experience Water, As It Should Be?",
      "buttoncontent_sdkmvoqyz8_html": "Complete Purchase",
      "headingtext_8muvmowjihd_html": "POSTreat Fluoride Removal Filter Cartridge\n",
      "textcontent_oxdryx2koo_html": "<ul><li>Our additional POSTreat filter removes more than \n95% of fluoride for highly targeted filtration</li><li>Works in tandem with Phoenix Gravity Filters made of \n304 grade stainless steel</li><li>Works in conjunction with&nbsp; Phoenix Gravity Smart Carbon Cartridges</li><li>Designed for maximum reuse, the first on the market \nwith refillable environmentally-friendly materials<br></li></ul>",
      "buttoncontent_9ejeb83mkor_html": "Shop Now",
      "buttoncontent_01csvdz1gwb4_html": "Shop Now",
      "headingtext_uvhw10d0pyo_html": "100-day Money Back Guarantee",
      "textcontent_m30nokcahx_html": "<ul><li>Purchase the Phoenix Gravity system.</li><li>Use the system for full 100 days.</li><li>If you don't get the best tasting water, send it back to us for a full refund - no questions asked.</li></ul>",
      "lightbox_button_title_5qr9ueq5gi2_html": "* Terms & Conditions",
      "100daymoneybackguarantee_5qr9ueq5gi2_html": "100-day money back guarantee",
      "headingtext_pxxoeoo73a_html": "FAQs",
      "item_title_0_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Which size filter is best for me?",
      "item_title_1_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I clean my filter?",
      "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I set it up myself?",
      "item_title_3_obyhwb3w3en_html": "How does the Phoenix Gravity Filter compare to plastic jugs or other filters?",
      "item_title_4_obyhwb3w3en_html": " Are Phoenix Gravity Smart Carbon Cartridges compatible with my gravity-fed system?",
      "textcontent_80uzn4j3wmr_html": "This depends on how many people will be using your Phoenix Gravity Water Filter, and\nhow much water you drink! Generally, we recommend:<div>6-Litre - Perfect pairing, for up to 1-2 people</div><div>8-Litre - In the middle, for up to 2-4 people</div><div>12-Litre - Family friendly, for 3-4 + people<div></div></div>",
      "textcontent_raelnx6yypb_html": "<b>Gravity Filter:</b> We recommend hand washing using warm soapy water and a non-abrasive cloth or sponge. Then, leave to air dry or buff with a microfiber cloth. (Don’t forget to remove your cartridges first!)<div><br></div><div><b>Cartridges: </b>Wash these under cold running water only and using a mildly abrasive scourer or brush, gently massage along cartridges from mount to end only - to avoid contamination.</div><div><br></div><div><b>POSTreat:</b> Again, use warm soapy water and a non-abrasive cloth/ sponge. Then, leave to air dry or buff with a microfiber cloth. (Don’t forget to remove the media first!)<div><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/1821/9557/files/Phoenix_Gravity___Carbon_cartridge.pdf?v=1693476936\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"></font></a></div></div>",
      "textcontent_tqip8ngf4mi_html": "Certainly! Our systems are designed to be extremely easy to assemble and everything you need will be included. You can do it yourself with just your hands - there’s no specialist tools, plumbers or electricians required.<div><br></div><div>We include full instructions with every unit and we’re always here to help. You can contact us <a href=\"/pages/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">here.</font></a><a href=\"/pages/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"></font></a></div>",
      "textcontent_c1473urz8kj_html": "Yes! Phoenix Gravity Smart Carbon Cartridges are precision-engineered to work with nearly all gravity-fed water systems. They’re built for reliable performance and deliver clean, safe, great-tasting water every time.",
      "headingtext_e59l5djug1d_html": "<p>&nbsp; Still have a burning question? See all our&nbsp; <a href=\"/pages/faq\" class=\"faq-link\">FAQs</a>&nbsp; here.</p>\n",
      "headingtext_kww11q25u6i_html": "The Phoenix difference, straight from the source(s)."
    },
