      "headingtext_t8c4g12xxm8_html": "Accessories",
      "headingtext_cgaiktrtrpi_html": "A better way to drink water, naturally.",
      "text0_8ack06n0lqi_html": "If you don’t like your water filter, within 100 days we’ll give you a full refund.",
      "buttoncontent_s0wbbr81o6_html": "Return Policy",
      "headingtext_moe14bitija_html": "Your health can only be as good as your water.<div></div>",
      "textcontent_yhdbpi7fg1r_html": "We’re always told to drink more water, but do you know what it actually does?<div bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:131,&quot;y&quot;:4696,&quot;w&quot;:560,&quot;h&quot;:25,&quot;abs_x&quot;:220,&quot;abs_y&quot;:4872}\"><br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:131,&quot;y&quot;:4696,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:23,&quot;abs_x&quot;:220,&quot;abs_y&quot;:4872}\"></div><div bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:131,&quot;y&quot;:4721,&quot;w&quot;:560,&quot;h&quot;:75,&quot;abs_x&quot;:220,&quot;abs_y&quot;:4897}\">The quality of your water impacts the quality of your sleep, skin, hair, immunity, brain power, health - and much, much more. Your body is made up of 60% water; you are what you drink.</div>",
      "buttoncontent_r69txgnks_html": "Text Button 2",
      "headingtext_hz7wwekgcmd_html": "But nutrient-rich, impurity-free water isn’t always on tap.<div></div>",
      "textcontent_yzor7f1ceg_html": "<div><div><div><div><b>Less than 1 percent</b> of the earth’s freshwater is accessible and <b>over three billion people</b> globally are at risk of disease because of unknown water quality. Almost <b>all of UK waters are polluted and almost a third of Europe’s</b> groundwater bodies are significantly affected by pollution.\n</div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div>Tap water can be contaminated by heavy metals, pesticides, chlorine byproducts, industrial pollutants and more - compromising its quality, taste, and impact on our health.  <b>We’re here to change that</b>.\n</div><div><br></div>",
      "headingtext_5whg2vchcbb_html": "What Phoenix Gravity Water Filters remove?",
