      "title4_cjwfins9og7_html": "99.99%",
      "name5_cjwfins9og7_html": "Viruses",
      "title5_cjwfins9og7_html": "99.9%",
      "name6_cjwfins9og7_html": "Bacteria",
      "title6_cjwfins9og7_html": "99.999%",
      "name7_cjwfins9og7_html": "Parasites",
      "title7_cjwfins9og7_html": "99.9%",
      "name8_cjwfins9og7_html": "Chlorine",
      "title8_cjwfins9og7_html": "99%",
      "headingtext_mevk83v2cg_html": "Here’s How It Works",
      "headingtext_jgoqkzp4vhm_html": "Better quality you can taste, on tap",
      "buttoncontent_76d19r2d2t_html": "Yes please!",
      "headingtext_vkmaqerxxy_html": "We’re here for your hydration.",
      "textcontent_mxtgphkfi1_html": "We believe that  <b>great-tasting,  impurity-free </b>water \nis a basic right - not a privilege. As the world’s leading manufacturer of gravity water flters, we’re on a mission to make  <b>healthier hydration</b> accessible to everyone,<div><br></div><div>wherever they need it most.\nWe also happen to be one of the oldest kids on the \nblock, bringing water back to its straight-from-the-<b>\nsource purity</b> since 1978.</div>",
      "buttoncontent_byenycgxa9_html": "Read  Our Story",
      "headingtext_t0u1977v2h_html": "Say hello to hydration, as it should be.",
      "buttoncontent_52ih3ryffny_html": "Shop Now",
      "headingtext_4vucrif9yhu_html": "The Phoenix Difference",
      "headingtext_o09n267yws_html": "Straight from the source(s)",
      "text0_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "“We were looking for a solid filter that would be easy to maintain, easy to build, long lasting, and effective. Meets the mark on all accounts!\"",
      "name0_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Andrew Narduzzi",
      "text1_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "“Had this for a few months. It works brilliantly. Haven't had to replace the filters yet. Quality is definitely good enough.\r\n”",
      "name1_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Last of The Meketrex Supplicants",
      "text2_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "“Well made unit, easy to assemble, reasonable rate of filtration, good value for money compared to other granular activated carbon filters.”",
      "name2_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Gary D",
      "text3_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "\"So much better than i thought it would be. It looks really good, very sturdy, and the water is so soft. Wish id bought one years ago.\"",
      "name3_1bdm5v211uqi_html": "Gilly K Edwards",
      "headingtext_8i6q4yzc5ai_html": "<u>Stay Connected.</u>"
