      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomme6dyrmm6ve_me6dyrmm6ve_html": "100-Day Free Trial",
      "ecomiconlisttitle1_ecomme6dyrmm6ve_me6dyrmm6ve_html": "2 Minutes To Set Up",
      "ecomiconlisttitle2_ecomme6dyrmm6ve_me6dyrmm6ve_html": "Portable And Lightweight",
      "ecomiconlisttitle3_ecomme6dyrmm6ve_me6dyrmm6ve_html": "Removes 99.9% Of Toxins",
      "headingtext_m0eqs7cmnz_html": "Trusted our water filters for over 50 years",
      "text0_3nitfg4huhw_html": "<h3>Good quality product at a reasonable price</h3><div></div>This was a bit fiddly to assemble, apart from that, i's a really good quality product. The cost of replacement filters is reasonable too, as they last for two years, it's on a par with other types of filters.",
      "name0_3nitfg4huhw_html": "mae",
      "text1_3nitfg4huhw_html": "<h3>Super easy and exactly what we were looking for</h3><div></div>We were looking for a solid filter that would be easy to maintain, easy to build, long lasting, and effective. Meets the mark on all accounts!",
      "name1_3nitfg4huhw_html": "\tAndrew Narduzzi",
      "text2_3nitfg4huhw_html": "<h3> Awesome product!!</h3><div></div>This is a wonderful product!!\r\nOne person found this helpful",
      "name2_3nitfg4huhw_html": "Cathy",
      "headingtext_nkafomu12kb_html": "Our most advanced water filter ever",
      "hotspot_label0_gjo2a90pknr_html": "Teak wood stand",
      "textCard0_gjo2a90pknr_html": "<ul><li>Compatible with 6L and 8L Phoenix Water Filter Systems.</li><li><div>Supports up to 25kg.</div></li></ul><div><br><div><br></div></div>",
      "hotspot_label1_gjo2a90pknr_html": "Carbon Cartridges",
      "textCard1_gjo2a90pknr_html": "<ul><li>Removes 99.99% of harmful\r\ncontaminants</li><li><div>Activated high grade (CTC 60) Smart Carbon Cartridges</div></li></ul><div> <br></div>",
      "hotspot_label2_gjo2a90pknr_html": "POSTreat ",
      "textCard2_gjo2a90pknr_html": "<ul><li>Housed in 304 stainless steel</li><li><div>FluoRid media to remove more than 95% of fluoride</div></li></ul><div><br><div><br></div></div>",
      "hotspot_label3_gjo2a90pknr_html": "Phoenix Gravity Water Filter",
      "textCard3_gjo2a90pknr_html": "<div></div><ul><li><div>304-grade stainless steel housing unit <br></div></li><li><div>10 minute self-assembly. No tools needed.\r\n<br></div></li></ul><br>",
      "headingtext_yqwwu68iin_html": "Designed for perfection",
      "title0_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "304 stainless steel is light weight, rust-resistant, and durable",
      "text0_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "<br>",
      "title1_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "Dual filtration system filters up to 2.25 litre of water per hour",
      "text1_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "<br><div><div></div></div>",
      "title2_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "Removes 99.9% of parasites, contaminants and heavy metals",
      "text2_qsvwgc2dtbc_html": "<br><div><div></div></div>",
      "title0_tjb8efyx5_html": "Drip-free metal tap dispenses delicious-tasting water",
      "text0_tjb8efyx5_html": "<br><div><div></div></div>",
      "title1_tjb8efyx5_html": "Filters last up to 50% longer than leading brands and can purify 18 months",
      "text1_tjb8efyx5_html": "<br><div><div><div></div></div></div>",
      "title2_tjb8efyx5_html": "Granular activated carbon from natural coconut husks removes bacteria and metals",
      "text2_tjb8efyx5_html": "<br><div><div><div></div></div></div>",
      "buttoncontent_hijyo626mmj_html": "Try it Risk - Free For 100 Days",
      "textcontent_5ixqm8marur_html": "Enjoy Safe, Delicious Drinking Water in 2 Minutes-Quick To set Up Easy To Clean, And £787.34s Cheaper Than Bottles Or An In-Home System!",
      "headingtext_q4pioazny3a_html": "Our Water has been tested by reputable 3rd parties and passed with flying colors",
      "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecomd2ydhp7gio_d2ydhp7gio_html": "Water quality association certificate",
      "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecom2hfsq6f73c7_2hfsq6f73c7_html": "Test report for bacteria &amp; Virus removal",
      "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecomhzb679gfmw_hzb679gfmw_html": "Test report for removal of heavy metals",
      "headingtext_9rb1axyr1qk_html": "The most convenient and affordable way to enjoy pure, clean drinking in your home",
      "buttoncontent_717wxjfsrey_html": "Try it Risk - Free For 100 Days",
      "textcontent_fhmm058j13d_html": "Enjoy Safe, Delicious Drinking Water in 2 Minutes-Quick To set Up Easy To Clean, And £787.34s Cheaper Than Bottles Or An In-Home System!",
      "title0_cx7zb4w02jp_html": "100-day risk-free trial",
      "text0_cx7zb4w02jp_html": "Worried the Phoenix Gravity Water Filter is too good to be true? Don't believe it will really remove as many contaminants as we promise?<div><br><div>We stand behind our product 100% - so you can trial our filter in your own home for 100 days risk-free. If you aren't fully satisfied with the purity of your water, send it back within 100 days for a full refund, no questions asked!<br></div></div><div>*T&amp;Cs apply<br></div>",
      "headingtext_hisorkjtx3j_html": "Drink crystal-clean, great-testing\nwater in 3 easy steps!",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Assemble Your Filter",
      "ecomiconlistdes_0_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Simply follow the instructions included in the box to put together your filter - it's super easy to set up and only takes 2 minutes.",
      "ecomiconlisttitle1_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Add Tap Water",
      "ecomiconlistdes_1_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Take off the lid and pour in tap water. The dual filters use natural kiln-fired ceramic filtration from the southern province of Spain to remove toxins.",
      "ecomiconlisttitle2_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Safe To Drink!",
      "ecomiconlistdes_2_ecomd36sh3re5xn_d36sh3re5xn_html": "Pour yourself a glass -you'll notice a clean, crisp taste you only get from filtered water that's had all the nasty chemicals removed!",
      "headingtext_x9pk2ai3y7f_html": "Try the phoenix risk-free\nfor 100 days",
      "textcontent_ys4k82ekbw_html": "We are confident in the transformative power of the Phoenix Gravity Water Filter. Hence, we offer a 100-day risk-free trial. It's not just a product: it's a commitment to your well-being and satisfaction.",
      "headingtext_ysteolvwfil_html": "Here's what's included:",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomdt400b7nux_dt400b7nux_html": "1x Stainless Steel Housing Unit",
      "ecomiconlisttitle1_ecomdt400b7nux_dt400b7nux_html": "2 x Carbon Filter Cartridges ",
      "ecomiconlisttitle2_ecomdt400b7nux_dt400b7nux_html": "1x Stainless Steel Tap",
      "ecomiconlisttitle3_ecomdt400b7nux_dt400b7nux_html": "1x Teak Wood Stand",
      "ecomiconlisttitle4_ecomdt400b7nux_dt400b7nux_html": "2 x POSTreat Fluorid Filter",
      "ecomiconlisttitle5_ecomdt400b7nux_dt400b7nux_html": "Backed by a 10-year warranty and 100-day money-back guarantee!",
      "buttoncontent_cp1q3zivqrq_html": "Try it Risk - Free For 100 Days",
      "textcontent_as6rcixl0ju_html": "Enjoy Safe, Delicious Drinking Water in 2 Minutes-Quick To set Up Easy To Clean, And £787.34s Cheaper Than Bottles Or An In-Home System!",
