      "name8_gdikoysv2pv_html": "Chlorine",
      "title8_gdikoysv2pv_html": "99%",
      "headingtext_4vqrejfn0w7_html": "How our 100-day trial works?",
      "textcontent_akfntgc60wj_html": "<ul><li>Purchase the Phoenix Gravity system.</li><li>Use the system for full 100 days.</li><li>If you don't get the best tasting water, send it back to us for a full refund - no questions asked.</li></ul><p>*<a href=\"/pages/delivery-and-returns\" target=\"_blank\">Terms and conditions</a> apply. Please send it back to return address. We will receive product, verify that it is not scratched, dented or broken. After verification, refund will be initiated.</p>",
      "headingtext_7r1lng6wjij_html": "FAQs",
      "headingtext_gl4ty8airwb_html": "Still have a burning question? See all our <a href=\"/pages/faq\" target=\"_blank\">FAQs </a>here.",
      "item_title_0_i11bewlh16i_html": "Which size filter is best for me?",
      "item_title_1_i11bewlh16i_html": "Can I clean my filter?",
      "item_title_2_i11bewlh16i_html": "Can I set it up myself?",
      "item_title_3_i11bewlh16i_html": "How does the Phoenix Gravity Filter compare to plastic jugs or other filters?",
      "item_title_4_i11bewlh16i_html": " Are Phoenix Gravity Smart Carbon Cartridges compatible with my gravity-fed system?",
      "textcontent_5zphreqhntn_html": "This depends on how many people will be using your Phoenix Gravity Water Filter, and\nhow much water you drink! Generally, we recommend:<div>6-Litre - Perfect pairing, for up to 1-2 people</div><div>8-Litre - In the middle, for up to 2-4 people</div><div>12-Litre - Family friendly, for 3-4 + people<div></div></div>",
      "textcontent_dzgt3bjzvr7_html": "<b>Gravity Filter:</b> We recommend hand washing using warm soapy water and a non-abrasive cloth or sponge. Then, leave to air dry or buff with a microfiber cloth. (Don’t forget to remove your cartridges first!)<div><br></div><div><b>Cartridges: </b>Wash these under cold running water only and using a mildly abrasive scourer or brush, gently massage along cartridges from mount to end only - to avoid contamination.</div><div><br></div><div><b>POSTreat:</b> Again, use warm soapy water and a non-abrasive cloth/ sponge. Then, leave to air dry or buff with a microfiber cloth. (Don’t forget to remove the media first!)<div><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/1821/9557/files/Phoenix_Gravity___Carbon_cartridge.pdf?v=1693476936\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"></font></a></div></div>",
      "textcontent_n1laf4myjrp_html": "Certainly! Our systems are designed to be extremely easy to assemble and everything you need will be included. You can do it yourself with just your hands - there’s no specialist tools, plumbers or electricians required.<div><br></div><div>We include full instructions with every unit and we’re always here to help. You can contact us <a href=\"/pages/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\">here.</font></a><a href=\"/pages/help-center\"><font color=\"#f1d14e\"></font></a></div>",
      "textcontent_hhq37rf1cg_html": "Yes! Phoenix Gravity Smart Carbon Cartridges are precision-engineered to work with nearly all gravity-fed water systems. They’re built for reliable performance and deliver clean, safe, great-tasting water every time.",
      "headingtext_7yt4sozijtk_html": "The Phoenix difference, straight from the source(s)."
    },
    "ecom-travel-edition1-litre-product": {
      "textcontent_4hsqam1kddl_html": "Advanced and sustainable on-the-go gravity filtration removes 99.99% of contaminants while retaining the nutrients your body needs. Perfect for travelling, hiking, camping - or whenever you need it most.",
      "textcontent_zn950xvplo_html": "Looking for a bigger size? <a href=\"/products/the-phoenix-gravity-water-filter\">Find it here.</a>",
      "include_taxes_od9nkm93eb_html": "Tax included.",
