      "buttoncontent_nm6en84xssb_html": "ADD",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomyiv869h2syo_yiv869h2syo_html": "100 day money back guarantee & 10 year warranty",
      "title0_pgohf5az5m_html": "Retaines 100% nutrients",
      "title1_pgohf5az5m_html": "Travel-friendly for on-the-go purification",
      "title2_pgohf5az5m_html": "304-grade stainless steel, designed for durability ",
      "title3_pgohf5az5m_html": "Less waste, fewer refills, lower cost",
      "title4_pgohf5az5m_html": "Better taste you can trust for 40+ years",
      "headingtext_kzm5oz6ibyf_html": "Product description:",
      "textcontent_asu4o5w8vv_html": "<ul><li>The Phoenix Gravity Mini is easy to set up in under 10 minutes.\n</li><li>Housed in 304-grade stainless steel, naturally toxin-free, BPA-free, non-leaching.\n</li><li>Impregnated with silver to prevent bacteria growth.\n</li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with modern technology and the highest-grade environmentally friendly materials for the most effective, sustainable and durable filtration on the market.\n<br></li></ul>",
      "textcontent_fwioclzh6w5_html": "<ul><li>Perfect to travel with, holding up to 1L of spring-like water any time.\n</li><li>Activated three-stage carbon filters made from highest grade coconut shells (CTC 60), removes 99.99% of contaminants while preserving 100% of the nutrients your body needs.\n</li><li>Our cartridges use an activated carbon block that traps physical contaminants more than 20 times smaller than jug filters. \n<br></li></ul>",
      "view_more_text_mjxa45idisl_html": "View more",
      "view_less_text_mjxa45idisl_html": "View less",
      "headingtext_1bq8trsa4is_html": "Designed for durability",
      "textcontent_0bjyqwllrl2_html": " <ul><li>Unlike plastic filters, Phoenix Gravity’s 304-grade stainless steel housing won’t leach toxins, polyurethane, microplastics or harmful chemicals into your water.\n</li><li>Rust-resistant to withstand the rigours of everyday use for 10+ years.\n</li><li>Our all-purpose activated carbon cartridges last up to two years. This means fewer replacements and lower cost per litre. \n<br></li></ul>",
      "headingtext_jvm5gffk0zq_html": "Better quality you can taste, on tap.",
      "buttoncontent_z4lc50doji_html": "Complete Purchase",
      "headingtext_chk5cqu3dlu_html": "Filtration At Its Finest",
      "title0_qbl9yeq98wd_html": "Removes 99.9% <br>of contaminants",
      "title0_pmbsjl1za78_html": "Highest-grade <br> stainless steel",
      "title0_xv01ui46n9_html": "Natural activated <br>carbon filtration",
      "title0_tbtc9rzqz8_html": "Planet-friendly <br> purification",
      "title0_t7rxsyn67ls_html": "Fresh taste you <br> can trust",
      "title0_6vjhvj0ej8j_html": "10 year warranty, 100 day <br>money back guarantee",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom36lvlbzar38_36lvlbzar38_html": "Fresh, nutrient-rich water funnels from streams into public water systems.",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomyoedyuks08_yoedyuks08_html": "It’s exposed to contaminants including heavy metals, parasites, chemical waste, pesticides + more.",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom9aeratndwo_9aeratndwo_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Filter purifies tap water through activated carbon cartridges made from the highest quality coconut shells",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomfpwbf8lnf87_fpwbf8lnf87_html": "The dense, porous wall removes 99.99% of contaminants - without altering your water’s oxygen or mineral content.",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecom1ps46lznnnv_1ps46lznnnv_html": "You and your loved ones enjoy fresh, nutrient-rich water with ease - just as nature intended",
      "headingtext_ejd86hagbhs_html": "The Phoenix Difference",
      "textcontent_70oj56rg3op_html": "Our three-stage activated carbon cartridges are designed for maximum reuse and minimum replacement, lasting up to 18 months. \n",
      "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecoma9tc0o6j4tn_a9tc0o6j4tn_html": "If you don’t like your water filter within 100 days, we’ll give you a full refund.",
      "buttoncontent_sxfsbvemo98_html": "Refund Policy",
      "headingtext_5ax63qnj3ex_html": "FAQs",
      "item_title_0_obyhwb3w3en_html": "How does the Phoenix Gravity Filter compare to plastic jugs or other filters?",
      "item_title_1_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I set it up myself?",
      "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I clean my filter?",
      "textcontent_gpc60jvzbtw_html": "Absolutely. The Phoenix Gravity Mini is designed for easy DIY set-up within minutes - no plumber, electricity or prior knowledge required. We’ll send detailed instructions, along with instructions on how to prime your cartridge, with your Phoenix Gravity Mini.<div><br></div>",
      "textcontent_ucnm135xkt_html": "Yes, it’s simple! You can easily clean your filter in your home using tap water and a soft brush or mild abrasive. We’ll include detailed instructions when we send your Phoenix Gravity Filter. \n<div><br></div>",
      "headingtext_fse1zusv2u9_html": "Still have a burning question? See our full FAQs <a href=\"/pages/faq\">here.</a>",
      "headingtext_7dack5fmz5p_html": "The Phoenix difference, straight from the source(s)."
    },
