    "ecom-our-tech-page": {
      "headingtext_pbl7pxzij7_html": "Welcome back to water",
      "textcontent_7qbupvoyq8v_html": "At Phoenix Gravity Water Filters, we’ve harnessed decades of innovation to bring you the purest drinking water.&nbsp;",
      "marquee_text0_7ifwlcyvjse_html": "Free UK delivery over £99",
      "marquee_text1_7ifwlcyvjse_html": "10 year warranty",
      "marquee_text2_7ifwlcyvjse_html": "Up to 99.9% contaminants removed",
      "marquee_text3_7ifwlcyvjse_html": "100 day money back guarantee",
      "headingtext_ekcezsei8cq_html": "Engineered to remove contaminants and improve taste ...",
      "textcontent_5a1xti0soxm_html": "for drinking water that’s pure, fresh and worry-free- we remove impurities and pollutants including:",
      "headingtext_r6h7l9g5yt_html": "...and retain minerals",
      "textcontent_d6nopws3eem_html": "Designed to preserve naturally occurring minerals ensuring healthy hydration and great taste.",
      "headingtext_eh0hh7rw95u_html": "...and retain minerals",
      "textcontent_e6qglleavaw_html": "Designed to preserve naturally occurring minerals ensuring healthy hydration and great taste.",
      "headingtext_87gvwza7cbk_html": "The science behind Phoenix Gravity water filters",
      "textcontent_9cz2kqdv1a_html": "For over <b>50 years</b> we’ve been manufacturing water filters <b>in-house</b> in a solar-powered factory. Inventing this design in the ‘80s, we have continued to innovate using the highest grade materials and independent testing to produce a multi-stage filtration system free from electricity or plumbing.",
      "headingtext_t8rxrxjwy4q_html": "The science behind Phoenix Gravity water filters",
      "textcontent_q19szg08kft_html": "For over <b>50 years</b> we’ve been manufacturing water filters <b>in-house</b> in a solar-powered factory. Inventing this design in the ‘80s, we have continued to innovate using the highest grade materials and independent testing to produce a multi-stage filtration system free from electricity or plumbing.",
      "headingtext_povcjxd64jo_html": "We take our performance seriously",
      "textcontent_5ockwur78zv_html": "Our filters are independently tested and verified.",
      "textcontent_1onjpgm1tor_html": "NSF Certified",
      "textcontent_w8s120uf10a_html": "Environmental Monitoring Service",
      "textcontent_ino62lt2lhr_html": "Water Quality Association",
      "buttoncontent_z2swdm47339_html": "View Reports",
      "headingtext_n8x4gjyapz9_html": "The difference real filtration makes",
      "textcontent_1hv7c2s13te_html": "Our filters remove contaminants that others don’t- both those you can see and those you can’t. Alongside our independent lab testing is our simple “Turmeric Test”.&nbsp;<div>This test uses turmeric as it’s extremely difficult to remove, demonstrating just a fraction of our filtration power.</div>",
      "headingtext_dyipa2b7ssr_html": "Experience healthier hydration",
      "headingtext_lvgozlkqzk8_html": "Our advanced filtration technology delivers pure, healthy water that can positively impact your wellbeing.",
      "textcontent_unymkaelepc_html": "\n<div>1. Cellular Regeneration</div><div>2. Optimal Sleep\n</div><div>3. Stronger Immune System\n</div><div>4. Enhanced Cognitive Function</div>",
      "textcontent_85k0u043jxx_html": "THE POSTREAT ADVANTAGE",
      "headingtext_dtgnhxft77i_html": "Go one step further for fluoride removal",
      "headingtext_ac17ie35rt_html": "Effective",
      "textcontent_48bb71f3iex_html": "Our advanced POSTreat filter provides over 95% fluoride removal for precise, targeted filtration.",
      "headingtext_vuj25t0rfq_html": "Perfectly Paired",
      "textcontent_zwhjv5qt49s_html": "Pairs seamlessly with Phoenix Gravity KoKoCarb Cartridges",
      "headingtext_uxw9ym7ab1s_html": "Refillable",
      "textcontent_1zna6w68t7u_html": "Our POSTreat Fluoride Removal cartridges are made from stainless steel and are refillable- a world first!",
      "headingtext_itn48iys7qj_html": "Why choose Phoenix Gravity",
      "headingtext_r5c7xg7dmvl_html": "How the Phoenix Gravity Filter Compares",
      "headingtext_99qll8va6r_html": "<div>304-grade stainless steel</div>",
      "textcontent_x5vckgwgiti_html": "Naturally BPA-free and rust-resistant for locked-in freshness. Our premium grade stainless steel comes with a 10 year warranty.",
      "headingtext_zmv9ctb6ovn_html": "Highest-grade activated coconut carbon",
      "textcontent_1m4hoz4tv9e_html": "We use CT90 premium coconut carbon for our KoKoCarb Cartridges. We form it into a highly dense porous carbon block. This enables us to continue removing 99.99% of contaminants for at least 12 months.",
      "headingtext_xfi54bx8dfp_html": "20 x more powerful",
      "textcontent_7cpo16y8fm4_html": "Our KoKoCarb Cartridges have a &lt;1 micron rating and an extended filtration contact time. Making them 20 x more effective than typical jug filters and those using granular carbon.",
      "headingtext_e8gv2st2qh_html": "Hear from our water expert",
      "textcontent_9zirz2baoxi_html": "Learn why our water filtration is the ultimate health hack.",
      "headingtext_ybt9841ka9_html": "The Phoenix Gravity Water Filter",
      "headingtext_b1xrnm6cn_html": "Our PRODUCTS",
      "headingtext_dgqnjhmwqhc_html": "Don’t just take our word for it, try it for yourself",
      "textcontent_ga98ym2kdg_html": "We highly recommend our best-selling system crafted with rust-resistant AISI 304 stainless steel, premium CTC-60 coconut carbon to remove up to 99.9% of contaminants, and our one-of-a-kind refillable POSTreat filters that reduce over 95% of fluoride.",
      "buttoncontent_9ugpsugf8jv_html": "Shop Now"
    }
  },
